{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-06_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-06","title":"臨界時刻","storyCode":"15-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8263ce1db638d7e3d4af1e8539885de3c7f4d26980b6f2eff0418edffe337426","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ceo"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我從未嘗試過利用黑王冠來接觸你的思維——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不必緊張，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我已經完全向你敞開我的內心和思維。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看向了自己的身側，那一束溫柔的白光正輕輕拉著她的手。\n她閉上眼，長舒一口氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我也不知道我們這趟旅程通往何處，但我會保護你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她在“魔王”的注視下，輕輕觸碰著你的額前——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的記憶和情感正向我流淌過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……感覺很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明它們的波動如此平靜溫和，明明記憶的盡頭並不遙遠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初特蕾西婭小姐到底看到了什麼——"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭看到你，看到了凱爾希，看到了自己，還有羅德島上許許多多的人。\n她越走越深，那個記憶的邊界已經觸手可及。“好奇”與“擔憂”致使她幾乎忘記了自己的目的，她想要觸及那道邊界……\n想要觸及你記憶的起點。切爾諾伯格、石棺，還有那個虛弱地伸出手的你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像還有其他的記憶？為什麼模糊不清？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_9"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你的手抓住了阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……你迷失了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道，這也是我第一次如此深入地接觸他人的思維，這種感覺……很奇異。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但好在你成功了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，博士，我現在能感受到你每一絲細微的情緒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也能感受到你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你現在很放鬆嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有阿米婭在，我並不需要擔心什麼。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"接下來，我們應該怎麼做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，拉緊我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的路，我會保護你走下去的。關於魔王的一切，特蕾西婭小姐在那一天已經全部教給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那條路的前面，“她”已經在等著我們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我理解你的理由，但我無法提供，你的請求違背了DWDB-221E的核心邏輯。\n但我可以提供繞過限制的方法，凱爾希——\n“深潛”。\n可惜連特蕾西婭也無法走到如此遙遠的地方，其中的風險遠遠超過了她所能承受的範圍——\n你並不奢求從我這裡獲得答案？那為何你如此執著於求助我存取這些於你無益的數據？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我無法確認是否終有一天，阿米婭會向你提出同樣的問題。但我希望，她能在黑暗中找到我為她照亮的方向。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希便是如此回答我，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……請問您能為我們調出凱爾希醫生的所有存取記錄嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她每一次的疑惑、每一次的堅持，還有每一次的失落離去，我將無一保留地展示給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你也曾深入過“文明的存續”，但這一次，你所尋找的東西遠在邊際之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是泰拉生命暫時無法踏足的領域，但或許你有機會接觸那些不屬於你們的知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你的同行者——Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……我？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很快便會知曉我的意思，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨我來吧，阿米婭，來到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"narration","text":"“文明奇點”。\n純白巨型長廊環繞著中央那不可捉摸的點——“奇點”。\n龐雜的資訊流不斷從奇點中溢出，能夠被你們所捕獲的資訊皆是足以被你們理解的知識。\n阿米婭看不到來時的路。但要是沿著長廊繼續走下去，在浪費了難以估量的時間後，阿米婭終將回到原點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你發現了，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文明發展的停滯並非意味著原地踏步，時間依舊會在線性的軌跡上不可逆轉地向前推進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但生命所創造的和所發現的一切卻只會陷入無法脫離的循環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數學、物理、哲學、神學等各種理論和實踐都無法再創造希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向上的螺旋已經失效，生命將在迷失方向的道路上空耗他們的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……這裡就已經是邊界？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是泰拉目前所能觸碰的知識邊界。它既是限制，也是保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"某種思維認知的保護……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"思維認知？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像我們沒辦法強迫小沙地獸計算洋流的規律？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哪怕我們能給出所有的數據和公式……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"硬來依舊會傷害牠們的小腦瓜。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的直覺很敏銳，博士，但並非完全準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DWDB-221E會啟迪生命穩步走向未來，而非簡單將未來的碎片展現於求索者的眼前，導致違背自然規律與倫理的演化飛躍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，知識是不可逆轉的。瞥見過真實天空的理想家將不再甘願蒙昧地安眠於大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而超越文明本身思維認知極限的資訊，只會變成誘惑他們忽視現實，走向毀滅陷阱的毒藥，繼而將他們的文明帶入深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，邊界誕生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但為什麼邊界的構成……像是某種龐大的資料伺服器組成的監牢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它以你所能接受的形態出現，一如DWDB-221E在物質界以一頂黑色冠冕的形態陪伴著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對渺小的螻蟻而言，邊界可以是一條首尾相連的湍急河流，永遠無法匯入大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而對壽命以萬億年計量的天體而言，邊界亦可以是伴隨其一生的引力場，不可捉摸，不可逃脫。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你走向了與虛空一步之遙的斷面，遙遠中心處的“奇點”在吸引著你。\n資訊如波浪般輕輕地從你身旁掠過，卻足以讓你一瞥許多新奇的場景。\n那是屬於你過去的浮光掠影——你失去後又遺忘的生活。\n一個“陌生時代”的幻影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，小心！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭緊張地拉住了你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒辦法確認從邊界墜下會發生什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是……你看到的……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……你我思維相通……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……你能看到我所看到的……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“源石蟲的卵鞘”、“穿過星星之間的獨木橋”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所有那些故事都是真實存在的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“源石蟲的卵鞘”？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“穿過星星之間的獨木橋”？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在很小很小的時候，我遇到了一個很在意的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人明明自己也脆弱得不行，卻一定要固執地背著我跨過滿是源石碎屑的小徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我發燒昏昏沉沉，但又害怕惡夢不敢睡覺的時候，那個人也會不厭其煩地跟我講那些我從未聽過的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在逼仄黑暗的礦洞裡，那個人也會毫不猶豫地砸碎自己好不容易找到的礦石樣本——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後把那些發光的小石頭嵌在四周的岩壁上，為我講述星星，還有坐落在雲天之上的樂園的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，願意聽聽那個人跟我講的故事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"當然。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一個人，總是獨自駕駛著像是源石蟲卵鞘的神奇載具穿過星星之間的獨木橋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最為幽靜的夜晚，也有引路人從上了年紀的星星那裡借來發光的雲朵，造出圓圓的鏡子照亮前路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在獨木橋的另一頭，尖塔在大氣潮汐中若隱若現，還有戴在星星額頭上的花環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當降落在花環上時，會發現那裡是一座很大很大的遊樂場，而可愛的好孩子們會聚集在那裡肆意玩耍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但駕駛載具的人卻很難停下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那人會換到一艘最神奇的載具裡，駕駛著它駛過漫長的歲月……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而歲月的盡頭，卻空無一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是……我？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"為你講故事的人……是我？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭緊緊地握住了你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由於感染的緣故，那時我很難記住很多的東西，我也無法理解故事裡的很多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會努力去想，盡全力去記住你講過的每一個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那是屬於我的故事，是你送給我的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不想忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，沒想到今天我終於可以把這些你送我的禮物再分享給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我們已經共同親眼見證。於我，於你，都重新認識了那段逝去的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"謝謝你，阿米婭……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你會嚮往那樣的生活嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"嚮往。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也難怪。和博士一樣，第一次想到那些奇妙的生活時，我也嚮往過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的生活是我無論如何也沒辦法真正觸碰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會忍不住偷偷和特蕾西婭小姐分享，我們會用許多奇怪的想像增添更多的細節——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到它變得面目全非，變得越來越遙不可及……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在親眼瞥見一點點之後，我反而覺得自己和你過去的生活不再那麼遙遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，你相信我們的這片大地終有一天也會如那樣美好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"不嚮往。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我相信。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們會見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島會見到的。"}]},{"label":"會有那麼一天的。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們會見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島會見到的。"}]},{"label":"也許會更好……","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們會見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島會見到的。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許只是不願意將殘酷的另一面分享給你。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。快樂背後的殘酷、痛苦背後的喜悅，我們的確都已體驗過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我也偷偷向特蕾西婭小姐分享過那些奇妙的故事，她同樣為此驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直渴望著卡茲戴爾……不，是渴望著這片大地的每個人都有機會體驗那樣的生活。也因此她不斷努力著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可不能落後啊，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許終有一天，羅德島也能在這片大地上見證那樣的生活。"}]},{"label":"我始終堅信生活的背面永遠存在，阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。快樂背後的殘酷、痛苦背後的喜悅，我們的確都已體驗過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我也偷偷向特蕾西婭小姐分享過那些奇妙的故事，她同樣為此驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直渴望著卡茲戴爾……不，是渴望著這片大地的每個人都有機會體驗那樣的生活。也因此她不斷努力著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可不能落後啊，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許終有一天，羅德島也能在這片大地上見證那樣的生活。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們接下來該怎麼做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“深潛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"DWDB-221E所儲存的完整數據會經由奇點解碼並輸出合理且適當的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅靠阿米婭無法突破其核心邏輯的限制。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……我是特例？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚未可知，但的確存在這樣的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些資訊，我們如何接近呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，阿米婭，對此我並無更加有效的資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我能夠不斷搜尋凱爾希所留下的線索，讓可能對你們有用的資訊在排序上更容易被找到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也許能搭建一座橋？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橋？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"通向奇點的橋。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"通向知識的橋。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"凱爾希不是已經為我們指引了前路嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾有人這麼做過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記錄中並無先例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……無論如何，值得一試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這其中的風險你們必須知曉，越靠近奇點，資訊的密度會越高，你們甚至極有可能體驗到資訊的質量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"資訊存在質量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，它存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且未完全篩選的資訊有機率如洪流般摧毀你們的思維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而思維湮滅意味著……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"死亡。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自內心響起的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）旅者，我只是在目睹又一次毀滅的發生罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自內心響起的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）希爾達，這是你的名字吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在叫我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法理解你的語言。而且，你是怎麼知道——"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯透過舷窗看到那個深空中的身影慢慢向自己所在的艦船靠近，繼而消失在了視野之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屈光者，請問那是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激烈的歌聲）♪——♪——♪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——您怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們很少有人喜歡她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，旅者，我實在無法容忍自己與她共處一室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的其他朋友要是看到了，也會因為這個唾棄我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當困惑的卡特斯回過神來時，整間艙室中除了她已經空無一人。在預感到某個不受歡迎的人到來之前，所有人都已經提前離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後卡特斯看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必驚訝，我學習過透過遠距離共振進行交流的技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，在毀滅那個奇特的種族之前，我保留下了他們進化出的獨特語言模式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……毀、毀滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘆氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新來的客人，你也對毀滅的行為不齒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……並不清楚發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並不複雜，我們的族群曾經以噬星為生。其他人所厭惡的，無非是我們賴以生存的本能而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如今我們的過往都只是流傳於旁人口中的恐怖奇談罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的族群幾近滅絕，恐怕我已經是最後一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我們以毀滅為生，最終當真正的毀滅降臨於我們的面前時，我們卻無能為力……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自那以後，作為苟活者，我已經在幾位天才的幫助下改變了攝入生存必要能量的方式——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來……您也正試著融入另一種生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以剛剛您在深空中注視著那顆死去的星球，也是在緬懷您所經歷的毀滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"緬懷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，並非如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的每個人都坦然且樂觀地接受毀滅追上我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
